---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TriviumCard from '../../../components/TriviumCard.astro';
import InfosCard from '../../../components/InfosCard.astro';
import PiariumCard from '../../../components/PiariumCard.astro';
---

<Layout locale="en" title="Projects · Open-source systems — Astrmira" description="Explore Astrmira projects: TriviumDB, infOS, and the Piarium agent harness." route="projects">
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="page-title"><p class="eyebrow">PROJECTS / OPEN SOURCE</p><h1>Ideas,<br /><em>made tangible.</em></h1><p>From the data core in TriviumDB and the companion runtime in infOS to sustained execution in Piarium, we build research into systems people can use.</p></section>
    <section class="directory-content" data-project-directory>
      <div class="directory-toolbar"><div class="filters" aria-label="Filter projects"><button class="filter-button" data-project-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All projects</button><button class="filter-button" data-project-filter="data" aria-pressed="false">Data systems</button><button class="filter-button" data-project-filter="agents" aria-pressed="false">Agents</button><button class="filter-button" data-project-filter="harness" aria-pressed="false">Agent harness</button></div><p class="tiny-note" data-project-count aria-live="polite">3 projects</p></div>
      <div class="project-grid"><TriviumCard locale="en" /><InfosCard locale="en" /><PiariumCard locale="en" /></div>
      <div class="archive-note"><div><h2>Research and products<br />move in both directions.</h2></div><p>Research gives systems new methods. Real use gives research new questions.</p></div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <section class="wrap"><div class="collaborate-block"><div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:18px">LET’S ASK THE NEXT QUESTION</p><h2>The next question worth studying<br />may come from you.</h2><p>Databases and intelligent systems · Research collaboration · University partnerships<br />A meaningful collaboration can begin with one real problem.</p></div><a href="/en/collaborate/" data-route="collaborate" class="button button-primary">Start a conversation <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div></section>
</Layout>
